stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_insert_function"'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_insert_type"'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_insert_field"'
! stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_insert_composite_element"'
stdout '"name":\s*"refactor_extract_type"'
stdout 'Keyed literals of the explicit owner type may group one contiguous source-order run of selected keys'
stdout 'value-expression bytes and evaluation count are preserved, along with Go-specified ordering of function calls, method calls, and receives'
stdout 'Go leaves the relative order of ordinary operands such as variable reads and indexing unspecified'
stdout 'does not promise a compiler-specific schedule'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_set_doc_comment"'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_maven_compile"'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_maven_test"'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_organize_imports"'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_replace_body"'
stdout '"name":\s*"refactor_change_signature"'
stdout 'complete existing-parameter permutations, and removal of exactly one unused scalar parameter'
stdout 'Preserve surviving parameter names, types, exact argument source, and order'
stdout '"name":\s*"refactor_introduce_parameter"'
stdout '"name":\s*"refactor_introduce_parameter_object"'
stdout '"name":\s*"semantic_replace_decl"'
